{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f42657a7d6a5654c20047a6613e96373de0083e9e3c8678dc1b5e4287cb4ad9c","ja":"自信を持って！","zh":"要对自己有信心！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"05e5ec40b4a5a6fca12f044ab8beba851f4d1885aa19c521f79ca8bdd278d529","ja":"はぁ～……社長さんとの挨拶、\nすっごく緊張しちゃったよ！","zh":"哈啊～……和社长打招呼，\n真的紧张死我了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0005501203863a3c8aaa85c2bb3189497777e49569314bdb4dde20d949ec6ef4","ja":"私も、ぎこちなかったかも。\n朋花ちゃんみたいには、なかなかできないわね……。","zh":"我可能也有点笨拙。还真是不太容易做到像朋花那样呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bea10bff0cde51d4b40f3071fae054bed27a51f2608f890b8b54fb4c9dcbf4f7","ja":"心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ～。\n気持ちは伝わったはずですから～。","zh":"不用担心，没事的哦～  \n你的心意应该已经传达到了～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9d216d704817413626ffba7dd3553cbb1bd51b40df6ad345a1b9f05520d1fa31","ja":"ですが、少しもったいない気もしますね～。\nせっかくスカジの物を身に付けてきたのですから。","zh":"不过，总觉得还是有点可惜呢～。\n既然都特意穿戴了スカジ的东西。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2d71f145a715081eefe6c2b1295f6f02db6ea29d593417f6d5e898c566b84ea2","ja":"あ……そ、そうね！","zh":"啊……对、对哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"87918cf51697321054ac1ea84b93ccf066ed00d368cef9126976b39cdc9dd01f","ja":"今日はみんな、●●●●プロデューサーさんに\n買っていただいたアイテムを身に着けてたんだわ。","zh":"今天大家都戴着●●●●制作人买的道具呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"01c7a7c171483ac18c6d5ad164aff7f38f4a6135ebb98a9b31078cd84cfabf60","ja":"とっておきのアクセサリーをつけている姫たちは、\nとびきり・きゅーと！な女性なのですよ♪","zh":"戴着珍藏饰品的公主们，都是超级可爱的女性哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"064046b2008e8dd0d4dac1058cc38a37e6a9a517580eaddb28400c181d531320","ja":"だからみんな、自信を持つのです！","zh":"所以大家，要有自信！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"308f56a04fbe8c26d428f6e41a3bc40fa75420146a9a2c1c1c1d2817a6f7419e","ja":"おお……そう言われたら、\nなんか力がわいてくる気が……無敵状態って感じ！？","zh":"哦哦……你这么一说，\n感觉好像涌出了一股力量……简直像进入无敌状态了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"08cf9542a898c4f60ca9bbc6d8b49fc61312a244fb85f04b4cb30c6f55279c8b","ja":"む、無敵……とまではいかないけど、\nわ、私もちょっとは、自信がでてきた……かも。","zh":"虽、虽然还称不上无敌……  \n但、但是我也稍微有点自信了……吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"b5fd8129bcc5a0cba6a8a48edf410b8a01e049bb80510d97d81f3aa0a44191f3","ja":"はい～。ですから、胸を張って、\n優雅に笑ってお話しすればいいんですよ～。","zh":"好～。所以，抬头挺胸，优雅地微笑着交谈就好了～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"c7e8671be6988fd078dc48624e915e4c8813f8295cc1b3cfa79154ebe7c35174","ja":"そっか……ボク、自分から話しかけにいってみるよ！\nまずはお仕事で、たくさんお世話になった人から！","zh":"这样啊……那我就试着主动去和他们搭话吧！\n先从那些在工作中给予过我很多帮助的人开始！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1feb9f536ddadb9d46ea439638cfe45234e612cb2346180355a437d1486165d8","ja":"私も、もっと積極的になってみるわ。\n朋花ちゃんとまつりちゃんをお手本に、ね♪","zh":"我也试着变得更积极主动一些吧。\n以朋花和茉莉为榜样♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"d69525eefbbbeea28949b4a23d9c6ecce7a336513b3409ec599ce4b6f7a44fc2","ja":"（……あ。確かあの方は、\n写真撮影でお世話になった……）","zh":"（……啊。那位好像是曾在拍摄照片时帮过我的……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"b0c913a4bd2175b424ede27c4b8ae1066a821d138e69e6d177025ab42563e503","ja":"あの、撮影の時はお世話になりました。\nそれで……。","zh":"那个，之前拍摄时承蒙您照顾了。\n然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"5a3c8a38452661d6c2f66152e98f22cdb674b94e6a91a27b6ccb8a269bd36ba0","ja":"（歌織さんも、みんなも……話しかけてる……。\nわ、私も……！）","zh":"（歌织小姐，还有大家……都在搭话……。\n我、我也要……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"e22972b4d79497769bdf3760b7bb8439e9e115c27ed6e59aafdc40f091bdb635","ja":"「あら？　そちらにいらっしゃるお嬢さん、\nミラス・ミランの……？　お写真、素敵でしたよ」","zh":"「あら？那边那位小姐，是米拉斯·米兰的……？照片拍得很棒哦。」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1781.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"ba3e16c62a475c0d91feb3d1aeed7ce66ff95a352cf2b5d0e905d9cdbe7c493c","ja":"あ……っ！　あ、ありがとうございます……。\n私、765プロの……。","zh":"啊……！谢、谢谢您……。\n我……是765制作人的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
